  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Dong Fang Chang Fan’s immemorial ruin bat wisdom path inheritance ground, Lu Qing Ming claps after spreading his arms like a bird, and the wind of that clap becomes the attack mass aimed at a desolate level phantom beast carrying Han Dong. Su Guang names the immortal killer move on the spot and expects it to free Han Dong if it lands.",
      "chapters": [
        785
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_dong_fang_chang_fan",
        "char_lu_qing_ming",
        "char_han_dong",
        "char_su_guang",
        "sys_killer_moves"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Wind blades gather and separate under his thoughts. If the phantom beast turns phantom and the attack would hit Han Dong, he can split the mass in time; splitting widens range but lowers power, which he expects would let Han Dong survive. When Pi Shui Han’s water lotus rises under the mass, Lu Qing Ming splits again, loses a small portion to the lotus, then reforms a smaller entangled wind toward the beast. A strength path giant hand from the clouds grabs that mass; both the hand and the entangled wind dissipate, and the phantom beast escapes into the palace below.",
      "chapters": [
        785
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "control",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_pi_shui_han",
        "move_myriad_self_giant_hand"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Among the Traveling Three Elites, Lu Qing Ming is named a wind path Gu Immortal whose signature move is entangled wind, called very powerful and maneuverable. Dong Fang Chang Fan had used the immemorial ruin bat corpse as a temporary base when he tried to revive through Dong Fang Yu Liang.",
      "chapters": [
        1184
      ],
